(7396521, 1163558, 114285, '<td valign="top">I really love this one, the bokeh and the light is gorgeous, I don''t like the upper left hand blank space, my eye is drawn to it. Still, very lovely 7</td>', 'I really love this one, the bokeh and the light is gorgeous, I don''t like the upper left hand blank space, my eye is drawn to it. Still, very lovely 7', '2015-08-11 05:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
