(7396528, 1163142, 114285, '<td valign="top">Thanks for dedicating this to me, hehe - they''re my initials ;)<br/> <br/>Love the vanishing point, only to be greeted with a person and those birds, always the birds!<br/> <br/>In my top 3</td>', 'Thanks for dedicating this to me, hehe - they''re my initials ;) Love the vanishing point, only to be greeted with a person and those birds, always the birds! In my top 3', '2015-08-11 05:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7396529, 1163523, 114285, '<td valign="top">Epic image!</td>', 'Epic image!', '2015-08-11 05:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7396530, 1163368, 114285, '<td valign="top">Brilliant tones in this one, and gorgeous light!<br/> <br/>Not sure the title suits the photo, there''s one child in the photo and she doesn''t seem to be running :) I also would suggest plain clothing next time so the eyes are not drawn to the print on her pretty dress, a white flowing one would''ve looked awesome.<br/> <br/>Still nevertheless this is very pretty indeed 7</td>', 'Brilliant tones in this one, and gorgeous light! Not sure the title suits the photo, there''s one child in the photo and she doesn''t seem to be running :) I also would suggest plain clothing next time so the eyes are not drawn to the print on her pretty dress, a white flowing one would''ve looked awesome. Still nevertheless this is very pretty indeed 7', '2015-08-11 05:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7396599, 1163590, 159723, '<td valign="top">I think this is wonderful! Lovely muted color and light. Nice and sharp capture. One of my top three.</td>', 'I think this is wonderful! Lovely muted color and light. Nice and sharp capture. One of my top three.', '2015-08-11 12:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7396602, 1163411, 159723, '<td valign="top">Great capture and I love the processing. I particularly like that you have resisted cranking up the exposure and clarity in the foreground. The darkness feels very natural. Actually it almost feel like I''m sitting on one of the stones looking out on the water and mountains. It`s a 9 from me :) Good Luck</td>', 'Great capture and I love the processing. I particularly like that you have resisted cranking up the exposure and clarity in the foreground. The darkness feels very natural. Actually it almost feel like I''m sitting on one of the stones looking out on the water and mountains. It`s a 9 from me :) Good Luck', '2015-08-11 12:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7396603, 1163276, 159723, '<td valign="top">I think this image is stunning and your daughter looks cute as a button :) DOF is great and the light coming through her hair and filling the background looks warm and wonderful. It`s a 9 from me and top 5 in my opinion. Best of luck!</td>', 'I think this image is stunning and your daughter looks cute as a button :) DOF is great and the light coming through her hair and filling the background looks warm and wonderful. It`s a 9 from me and top 5 in my opinion. Best of luck!', '2015-08-11 12:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7396609, 1163604, 159723, '<td valign="top">In my eyes the top is a tiny tiny bit too dark, but the rest is awesome. Great composition. The warm colour and golden light is perfect for this scenery.</td>', 'In my eyes the top is a tiny tiny bit too dark, but the rest is awesome. Great composition. The warm colour and golden light is perfect for this scenery.', '2015-08-11 12:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7396612, 1163197, 159723, '<td valign="top">Fabulous capture! It''s a 9 from me. Don''t really have anything else to say :) Best of luck!</td>', 'Fabulous capture! It''s a 9 from me. Don''t really have anything else to say :) Best of luck!', '2015-08-11 12:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
