(7397527, 1163298, 62249, '<td valign="top">Good expression of intensity on the skater''s face. The lighting on the face is just right, too.</td>', 'Good expression of intensity on the skater''s face. The lighting on the face is just right, too.', '2015-08-15 15:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397528, 1163442, 62249, '<td valign="top">A lovely scene with good foreground, mid ground, and background elements.</td>', 'A lovely scene with good foreground, mid ground, and background elements.', '2015-08-15 15:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397529, 1163530, 62249, '<td valign="top">Wow. So much interesting stuff going on in this image. I love the saturated colors, the red umbrellas, the industrial superstructure in the background.</td>', 'Wow. So much interesting stuff going on in this image. I love the saturated colors, the red umbrellas, the industrial superstructure in the background.', '2015-08-15 15:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397530, 1163636, 62249, '<td valign="top">This is a potentially interesting photo. Would''ve liked it better minus the dark blob (a bird, perhaps?) in the sky near the left edge, and if there were more visual separation between the two walkers (for example, if she were one step ahead of him so we could see more of her).</td>', 'This is a potentially interesting photo. Would''ve liked it better minus the dark blob (a bird, perhaps?) in the sky near the left edge, and if there were more visual separation between the two walkers (for example, if she were one step ahead of him so we could see more of her).', '2015-08-15 15:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397532, 1163457, 62249, '<td valign="top">Nice bokeh.</td>', 'Nice bokeh.', '2015-08-15 15:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397533, 1163680, 62249, '<td valign="top">Love the way the water tonality changes between the shore and the perfectly razor-straight horizon.</td>', 'Love the way the water tonality changes between the shore and the perfectly razor-straight horizon.', '2015-08-15 16:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397534, 1163197, 62249, '<td valign="top">There''s an unexpected sweetness to this image. The title really helps viewers connect with the insect.</td>', 'There''s an unexpected sweetness to this image. The title really helps viewers connect with the insect.', '2015-08-15 16:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397535, 1163600, 62249, '<td valign="top">The composition needs a stronger single element to draw people''s attention.</td>', 'The composition needs a stronger single element to draw people''s attention.', '2015-08-15 16:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397536, 1163590, 62249, '<td valign="top">Yet another in a series of great water-oriented shots over the past few months. Delightful.</td>', 'Yet another in a series of great water-oriented shots over the past few months. Delightful.', '2015-08-15 16:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397537, 1163545, 62249, '<td valign="top">A very cool portrait. The lighting on the rim of the guitar is great, and the sunglasses rock.</td>', 'A very cool portrait. The lighting on the rim of the guitar is great, and the sunglasses rock.', '2015-08-15 16:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397538, 1163379, 62249, '<td valign="top">Remarkable colors. A well processed image.</td>', 'Remarkable colors. A well processed image.', '2015-08-15 16:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397539, 1163601, 62249, '<td valign="top">Cool silhouette. Image seems a little soft, but gradation from yellow to blue is lovely.</td>', 'Cool silhouette. Image seems a little soft, but gradation from yellow to blue is lovely.', '2015-08-15 16:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397540, 1163173, 62249, '<td valign="top">Lighting on the foreground rocks is excellent and is a cool visual contrast to the smooth water and blurred clouds.</td>', 'Lighting on the foreground rocks is excellent and is a cool visual contrast to the smooth water and blurred clouds.', '2015-08-15 16:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397541, 1163293, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy.</td>', 'Very dreamy.', '2015-08-15 16:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397542, 1163643, 62249, '<td valign="top">Buggy captured at the perfect spot. Well seen and well framed.</td>', 'Buggy captured at the perfect spot. Well seen and well framed.', '2015-08-15 16:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397543, 1163469, 62249, '<td valign="top">The motion blur at the left edge is especially interesting.</td>', 'The motion blur at the left edge is especially interesting.', '2015-08-15 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397544, 1163549, 62249, '<td valign="top">Wow, a very different take on the challenge. The processing is excellent.</td>', 'Wow, a very different take on the challenge. The processing is excellent.', '2015-08-15 16:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397545, 1163672, 62249, '<td valign="top">Underexposed, and the tree''s shadow over the right edge of the logo isn''t as effective as I think you intended it to be.</td>', 'Underexposed, and the tree''s shadow over the right edge of the logo isn''t as effective as I think you intended it to be.', '2015-08-15 16:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397546, 1163371, 62249, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Lighting and processing are both lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful. Lighting and processing are both lovely.', '2015-08-15 16:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397547, 1163634, 62249, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the essence of summertime.</td>', 'You''ve captured the essence of summertime.', '2015-08-15 16:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397549, 1163574, 62249, '<td valign="top">A little too much HDR for my taste, but still a cool image.</td>', 'A little too much HDR for my taste, but still a cool image.', '2015-08-15 16:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397550, 1163655, 62249, '<td valign="top">There was potential here for a cool image. I think the strip mall in the background detracts from the scene.</td>', 'There was potential here for a cool image. I think the strip mall in the background detracts from the scene.', '2015-08-15 16:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397551, 1163421, 62249, '<td valign="top">Love the composition. Processing seems overdone.</td>', 'Love the composition. Processing seems overdone.', '2015-08-15 16:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397555, 1163632, 62249, '<td valign="top">Very appealing. The texture overlay works well.</td>', 'Very appealing. The texture overlay works well.', '2015-08-15 16:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397556, 1163692, 62249, '<td valign="top">An excellent portrait! The lighting on her hair, the dress and the edge of her foot are superb.</td>', 'An excellent portrait! The lighting on her hair, the dress and the edge of her foot are superb.', '2015-08-15 16:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397557, 1163642, 62249, '<td valign="top">The cast shadow is excellent</td>', 'The cast shadow is excellent', '2015-08-15 16:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397560, 1163558, 62249, '<td valign="top">Might''ve benefitted from a tighter crop, but the lighting and detail and bokeh are lovely.</td>', 'Might''ve benefitted from a tighter crop, but the lighting and detail and bokeh are lovely.', '2015-08-15 16:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397561, 1163142, 62249, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. Excellent leading lines, lovely lighting, and the 4 birds are the icing on the cake.</td>', 'Gorgeous. Excellent leading lines, lovely lighting, and the 4 birds are the icing on the cake.', '2015-08-15 16:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397563, 1163288, 62249, '<td valign="top">I like how the light area forms almost a heart shape around the bird.</td>', 'I like how the light area forms almost a heart shape around the bird.', '2015-08-15 16:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397564, 1163285, 62249, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this as a square crop, eliminating the right-most bale. That might draw more attention to the person. The lighting on the person is great.</td>', 'I''d like to see this as a square crop, eliminating the right-most bale. That might draw more attention to the person. The lighting on the person is great.', '2015-08-15 16:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397615, 1163596, 163081, '<td valign="top">voted earlier with an 8 but bump it up to 10.<br/>I really like this image. There is everything to look at. I keep focusing on the rocks and go up to discover the sunrise with the misty trees in the back. Then my eyes go back to the center of the image. Great image and nicely processed</td>', 'voted earlier with an 8 but bump it up to 10.I really like this image. There is everything to look at. I keep focusing on the rocks and go up to discover the sunrise with the misty trees in the back. Then my eyes go back to the center of the image. Great image and nicely processed', '2015-08-16 00:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397632, 1163691, 100831, '<td valign="top">glorious light.</td>', 'glorious light.', '2015-08-16 12:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397633, 1163089, 100831, '<td valign="top">oh my that''s so pretty!</td>', 'oh my that''s so pretty!', '2015-08-16 12:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
