(7397660, 1163301, 100831, '<td valign="top">A special place, I''m sure. Understated, great composition. I like all that.</td>', 'A special place, I''m sure. Understated, great composition. I like all that.', '2015-08-16 16:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397661, 1163276, 100831, '<td valign="top">Sparkles! What a treat.</td>', 'Sparkles! What a treat.', '2015-08-16 16:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397662, 1163549, 128323, '<td valign="top">This is nuts.  It''s a really gripping view, great use of Golden Hour, just hope nobody got hurt during this storm.</td>', 'This is nuts.  It''s a really gripping view, great use of Golden Hour, just hope nobody got hurt during this storm.', '2015-08-16 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397663, 1163077, 128323, '<td valign="top">The brightness of that bird defies the silhouettes behind it.  Great shot!</td>', 'The brightness of that bird defies the silhouettes behind it.  Great shot!', '2015-08-16 16:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397664, 1163368, 128323, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a Jake Olsen.  Great ethereal light, this should be on the front page in a few hours :)</td>', 'Reminds me of a Jake Olsen.  Great ethereal light, this should be on the front page in a few hours :)', '2015-08-16 16:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397666, 1163469, 128323, '<td valign="top">Great motion blur, and good use of grain to give your sky a nice gradient.</td>', 'Great motion blur, and good use of grain to give your sky a nice gradient.', '2015-08-16 17:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397667, 1163656, 128323, '<td valign="top">You should max out your pixel sizes and this would score better.  Use 1200 px on your longest side...</td>', 'You should max out your pixel sizes and this would score better.  Use 1200 px on your longest side...', '2015-08-16 17:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397668, 1163142, 128323, '<td valign="top">I love the golden boards on the left of the pier--I think this pic would have benefitted from some brightening and a bit of detail extraction on the boardwalk itself.  7</td>', 'I love the golden boards on the left of the pier--I think this pic would have benefitted from some brightening and a bit of detail extraction on the boardwalk itself.  7', '2015-08-16 17:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397669, 1163663, 128323, '<td valign="top">Great expression of golden light.</td>', 'Great expression of golden light.', '2015-08-16 17:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397670, 1163574, 128323, '<td valign="top">Holy wow!  Oh to live anywhere near something this magical.  Wonderful shot!</td>', 'Holy wow!  Oh to live anywhere near something this magical.  Wonderful shot!', '2015-08-16 17:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397671, 1163692, 128323, '<td valign="top">The glamour glow/high pass softening of your background is a bit distracting, but still a great expression of golden hour.  7</td>', 'The glamour glow/high pass softening of your background is a bit distracting, but still a great expression of golden hour.  7', '2015-08-16 17:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397682, 1163089, 94815, '<td valign="top">Imaginative flight of fancy as when pigs fly. Appropriate even without the golden hues.</td>', 'Imaginative flight of fancy as when pigs fly. Appropriate even without the golden hues.', '2015-08-16 17:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397683, 1163301, 94815, '<td valign="top">Golden indeed and natural. Could use some processing I think - maybe just a bit darker. 6 but could have been higher</td>', 'Golden indeed and natural. Could use some processing I think - maybe just a bit darker. 6 but could have been higher', '2015-08-16 17:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397684, 1163371, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good composition and light for the topic if a bit oversaturated on my MacPro retina monitor. voted earlier</td>', 'Good composition and light for the topic if a bit oversaturated on my MacPro retina monitor. voted earlier', '2015-08-16 17:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397685, 1163442, 94815, '<td valign="top">Lovely Western landscape. voted earlier</td>', 'Lovely Western landscape. voted earlier', '2015-08-16 17:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397686, 1163484, 94815, '<td valign="top">Captures the golden light better than most. I think a tighter crop would have added impact by emphasizing the light on the boats and clouds by giving up the buildings on the left and water at the bottom.  voted earlier</td>', 'Captures the golden light better than most. I think a tighter crop would have added impact by emphasizing the light on the boats and clouds by giving up the buildings on the left and water at the bottom.  voted earlier', '2015-08-16 17:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397687, 1163601, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good silhouette and flair.  voted earlier</td>', 'Good silhouette and flair.  voted earlier', '2015-08-16 17:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397689, 1163600, 94815, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and unforced processing. bump</td>', 'I like the composition and unforced processing. bump', '2015-08-16 17:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397694, 1163442, 29011, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Pulls one in. Offers a, wish I was there, feeling.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Pulls one in. Offers a, wish I was there, feeling.', '2015-08-16 17:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397695, 1163601, 29011, '<td valign="top">Love that moment the sun kisses the buildings. The small aperture adds that bit of sunburst that''s icing on the cake. Nicely captured :)</td>', 'Love that moment the sun kisses the buildings. The small aperture adds that bit of sunburst that''s icing on the cake. Nicely captured :)', '2015-08-16 17:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397698, 1163484, 29011, '<td valign="top">A very nicely composed and exposed for image. Lovely to look at. If I had to nitpick, I would only say the shadows appear a tad too dark and the clarity type effect (or other non-Lightroom equivalent) really deepens the texture to the water, it steals some of the focus off the boats. (non voter)</td>', 'A very nicely composed and exposed for image. Lovely to look at. If I had to nitpick, I would only say the shadows appear a tad too dark and the clarity type effect (or other non-Lightroom equivalent) really deepens the texture to the water, it steals some of the focus off the boats. (non voter)', '2015-08-16 18:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397699, 1163469, 29011, '<td valign="top">Most excellent display of a vanishing point I''ve seen in a while. Very creative. Splits the shot diagonally in a very appealing manner.</td>', 'Most excellent display of a vanishing point I''ve seen in a while. Very creative. Splits the shot diagonally in a very appealing manner.', '2015-08-16 18:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397700, 1163615, 29011, '<td valign="top">Super fun to photograph though not always easy getting close enough to these little critters. Congrats on that. Though the photo is over-exposed. A little too hot in the detail.</td>', 'Super fun to photograph though not always easy getting close enough to these little critters. Congrats on that. Though the photo is over-exposed. A little too hot in the detail.', '2015-08-16 18:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397708, 1163653, 112739, '<td valign="top">This is the winner in my book. Brilliant work.</td>', 'This is the winner in my book. Brilliant work.', '2015-08-16 20:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397709, 1163368, 112739, '<td valign="top">More brilliant work. Top honors.</td>', 'More brilliant work. Top honors.', '2015-08-16 20:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
