(7397765, 1163642, 108069, '<td valign="top">Very nice. We moved into a new (very old) house last year and I''m still fascinated with the way light bounces around, what it does to objects when we move them here and there as we try to find their right spot -- particularly at the early and late hours. Great concept and well done.</td>', 'Very nice. We moved into a new (very old) house last year and I''m still fascinated with the way light bounces around, what it does to objects when we move them here and there as we try to find their right spot -- particularly at the early and late hours. Great concept and well done.', '2015-08-17 00:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
