(7397796, 1163636, 108069, '<td valign="top">Bird : sign, two trash cans : two people. There''s a very interesting balance to this. I won''t pretend to know what you intended with what seems like a random and casual photo, but it''s reawakened memories of places and people with which and whom I''m unable to reunite. Having spent some time with this and only now noticing the title, how it''s punctuated, it''s personally haunting.<br/> <br/>For all of these things I''ve got to give you this.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1155941" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155941.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155941.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155941.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Bird : sign, two trash cans : two people. There''s a very interesting balance to this. I won''t pretend to know what you intended with what seems like a random and casual photo, but it''s reawakened memories of places and people with which and whom I''m unable to reunite. Having spent some time with this and only now noticing the title, how it''s punctuated, it''s personally haunting. For all of these things I''ve got to give you this. ', '2015-08-17 00:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
