(7397803, 1163368, 86447, '<td valign="top">7 from me.   I love it that this perfectly fits the challenge topic.  I love the hand in the hair... but her left arm... adds tension... I wish it were more relaxed so this would score better for you. <br/> <br/>If I hold my hand over her left arm, it makes an entirely different mood.<br/>But, I''m only one person and ... it''s still a very lovely image!</td>', '7 from me.   I love it that this perfectly fits the challenge topic.  I love the hand in the hair... but her left arm... adds tension... I wish it were more relaxed so this would score better for you.  If I hold my hand over her left arm, it makes an entirely different mood.But, I''m only one person and ... it''s still a very lovely image!', '2015-08-17 00:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397805, 1163640, 108069, '<td valign="top">Organic texture makes good. Light working overtime in every little speck. Interesting lines and shapes, organic and otherwise, silhouettes, and a great sense of near and far. Two realms. Time, perhaps. I don''t really care which way we go, but I''d like to join you.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1155933" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155933.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155933.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155933.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Organic texture makes good. Light working overtime in every little speck. Interesting lines and shapes, organic and otherwise, silhouettes, and a great sense of near and far. Two realms. Time, perhaps. I don''t really care which way we go, but I''d like to join you. ', '2015-08-17 00:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
