(7397820, 1163691, 108069, '<td valign="top">A thousand crystal prisms jabbing reflected light into the darkness, and winning. I love photographs like this because, in essence, you gave it a whirl and liked what you saw. And I like it, too. If you need me, I''ll be tracing these lines over and over with my eyes. Very cool stuff.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1155943" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155943.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155943.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155943.jpg"/></a></td>', 'A thousand crystal prisms jabbing reflected light into the darkness, and winning. I love photographs like this because, in essence, you gave it a whirl and liked what you saw. And I like it, too. If you need me, I''ll be tracing these lines over and over with my eyes. Very cool stuff. ', '2015-08-17 00:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7397821, 1163568, 108069, '<td valign="top">I admire the ability to observe the everyday. It''s still happening all around us, and though we have ever-new-more-bigger-faster-stronger channels of information, the everyday is still fascinating to me. To observe the shadows on this façade and share it is an act that has to be commended. And I really like the framing as well. This isn''t a picture of a house -- it''s a photo of how light plays on it.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1155942" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155942.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155942.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/105000-109999/108069/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1155942.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I admire the ability to observe the everyday. It''s still happening all around us, and though we have ever-new-more-bigger-faster-stronger channels of information, the everyday is still fascinating to me. To observe the shadows on this façade and share it is an act that has to be commended. And I really like the framing as well. This isn''t a picture of a house -- it''s a photo of how light plays on it. ', '2015-08-17 00:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
