(7397933, 1163142, 38032, '<td valign="top">It just occurred to me that Au is the elemental symbol for gold. I wonder what the symbol is for Blue ... a ribbon I guess ;)<br/> <br/>Congrats on a fantastic image that is both dreamy and foreboding -  a much appreciated contribution to our team this week. Not only as a first place finish, but also as a winner of Underground awards. Here''s hoping we will continue as a team in DPL long into the future =) This image at least gives us a shot at moving on another week ... ;)</td>', 'It just occurred to me that Au is the elemental symbol for gold. I wonder what the symbol is for Blue ... a ribbon I guess ;) Congrats on a fantastic image that is both dreamy and foreboding -  a much appreciated contribution to our team this week. Not only as a first place finish, but also as a winner of Underground awards. Here''s hoping we will continue as a team in DPL long into the future =) This image at least gives us a shot at moving on another week ... ;)', '2015-08-17 08:59:08.000000', NULL, 0),
