(7398042, 1163368, 65858, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your kind words, guys. There are definitely some flaws and I have room to grow (next time think about the clothing, watch, etc).<br/> <br/>But I''m very proud of the light and texture I captured - it''s exactly what I was hoping for when I set out - not to mention a wonderful memory and having fun shooting my girls!</td>', 'Thanks for your kind words, guys. There are definitely some flaws and I have room to grow (next time think about the clothing, watch, etc). But I''m very proud of the light and texture I captured - it''s exactly what I was hoping for when I set out - not to mention a wonderful memory and having fun shooting my girls!', '2015-08-17 14:49:24.000000', NULL, 0),
