(7398073, 1163688, 29011, '<td valign="top">Thanks for everyone''s comments. <br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smurfguy:</b></div><hr/><i> I think this deserved a higher score. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Jeff! :) Yeah I thought it might do a bit better but it''s not a total tank.  I got there with 15min left before the sun went in behind the skyscrapers. The last time I was in the same exact spot here was in the Winter months and I believed I should have more time left to shoot. I know the most golden light is when the sun is low but I should''ve left more time to explore. Perhaps the sun in the shot wasn''t too popular with folks. By the time I thought "run to the other ''Manhattan'' side" to take a shot of the light hitting it fully, it was a tad too late. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1163441" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/29011/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1163441.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/29011/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1163441.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/29011/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1163441.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1164241" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/29011/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1164241.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/29011/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1164241.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/29011/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1164241.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-08-17 16:06:12.</i></td>', 'Thanks for everyone''s comments.  Originally posted by smurfguy: I think this deserved a higher score.   Thanks Jeff! :) Yeah I thought it might do a bit better but it''s not a total tank.  I got there with 15min left before the sun went in behind the skyscrapers. The last time I was in the same exact spot here was in the Winter months and I believed I should have more time left to shoot. I know the most golden light is when the sun is low but I should''ve left more time to explore. Perhaps the sun in the shot wasn''t too popular with folks. By the time I thought "run to the other ''Manhattan'' side" to take a shot of the light hitting it fully, it was a tad too late.  ', '2015-08-17 17:00:55.000000', '2015-08-17 17:06:12.000000', 0),
